BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 694.89 Td (answering over an uploaded file.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 669.89 Td (The handbook is organised into nine sections covering attendance, leave, pay and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 654.89 Td (benefits, IT support, information security, workplace conduct, travel reimbursement,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 639.89 Td (learning, and where to get help. Each section states the process an employee would) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 624.89 Td (follow and the office that owns it.) Tj ET
