BT /F2 13 Tf 56.00 771.89 Td (2. Working hours and attendance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 739.89 Td (The standard working week is five days, Monday to Friday. Core hours are 09:30 to 17:30) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 724.89 Td (local time. Employees may flex their start time by up to sixty minutes with the approval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 709.89 Td (of their reporting manager, provided that total weekly hours are met.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 688.89 Td (- Record attendance daily in the approved attendance system before leaving the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 673.89 Td (  office.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 654.89 Td (- Inform your reporting manager before 10:00 if you will be late or absent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 639.89 Td (  unexpectedly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 620.89 Td (- A missed attendance record must be regularised within three working days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 597.89 Td (Hybrid working is permitted for eligible roles. Employees working remotely must remain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 582.89 Td (reachable during core hours, use the approved secure network, and attend scheduled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 567.89 Td (reviews in person when asked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 30 Td (Employee Handbook - demonstration sample - page 3 of 10) Tj ET
endstream
