BT /F2 13 Tf 56.00 771.89 Td (3. Leave policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 739.89 Td (Leave is grouped into casual leave, earned leave, sick leave, and special leave. All) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 724.89 Td (applications are raised in the HR self-service portal. The portal routes the request to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 709.89 Td (the reporting manager and then to the HR department for record keeping.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 684.89 Td (Planned leave should be applied for at least seven calendar days in advance. Unplanned) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 669.89 Td (leave should be applied for on the same day where possible. A medical certificate is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 654.89 Td (required for sick leave exceeding three consecutive days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 633.89 Td (- Casual leave is intended for short personal matters and is granted in half-day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 618.89 Td (  units.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 599.89 Td (- Earned leave accrues monthly and may be carried forward subject to the annual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 584.89 Td (  ceiling.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 565.89 Td (- Leave is approved only when a nominated colleague accepts the handover of urgent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 550.89 Td (  work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 527.89 Td (During probation, leave is limited to casual leave and sick leave unless the appointing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 512.89 Td (authority grants an exception in writing. Leave without pay requires approval from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 497.89 Td (department head.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 30 Td (Employee Handbook - demonstration sample - page 4 of 10) Tj ET
endstream
