BT /F2 13 Tf 56.00 771.89 Td (4. Pay, benefits, and reimbursements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 739.89 Td (Salary is credited on the last working day of each month. Payslips are published in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 724.89 Td (payroll portal three days before the credit date. Employees should verify their bank) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 709.89 Td (account details at least once a year.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 684.89 Td (Medical reimbursement claims must be submitted within ninety days of treatment along) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 669.89 Td (with original bills, a prescription, and the claim form. Claims above the standard limit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 654.89 Td (require prior approval from the medical board.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 633.89 Td (- Group medical insurance covers the employee, spouse, and dependent children.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 614.89 Td (- Annual health check-ups are reimbursed up to the published limit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 595.89 Td (- Queries about payslips, deductions, or tax declarations go to the payroll) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 580.89 Td (  helpdesk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 30 Td (Employee Handbook - demonstration sample - page 5 of 10) Tj ET
endstream
