BT /F2 13 Tf 56.00 771.89 Td (5. IT support) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 739.89 Td (The IT service desk is the single point of contact for laptop, network, software, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 724.89 Td (account issues. Tickets can be raised from the internal service portal or by calling the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 709.89 Td (helpdesk extension during business hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 684.89 Td (Before raising a ticket for a login problem, confirm the username, check that the device) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 669.89 Td (has network connectivity, and try the approved password-reset process once. Never share) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 654.89 Td (your password or a one-time code with support staff.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 633.89 Td (- Include the exact error message, the approximate time, the device type, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 618.89 Td (  steps to reproduce the issue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 599.89 Td (- Do not attach confidential business data in a screenshot unless the ticket) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 584.89 Td (  explicitly requires it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 565.89 Td (- Hardware replacement requires a ticket reference and manager approval.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 30 Td (Employee Handbook - demonstration sample - page 6 of 10) Tj ET
