BT /F2 13 Tf 56.00 771.89 Td (7. Workplace conduct) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 739.89 Td (Every employee is entitled to a workplace free from discrimination, harassment, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 724.89 Td (intimidation. The organisation maintains an internal committee under the applicable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 709.89 Td (prevention of sexual harassment framework.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 684.89 Td (Complaints may be raised in writing with the internal committee or with the human) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 669.89 Td (resources department. Complaints are handled confidentially, and retaliation against a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 654.89 Td (complainant is a disciplinary matter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 633.89 Td (- Communicate respectfully in meetings, email, and internal chat channels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 70.00 614.89 Td (- Declare conflicts of interest to the reporting manager in writing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 30 Td (Employee Handbook - demonstration sample - page 8 of 10) Tj ET
