BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 739.89 Td (Official travel must be approved in advance through the travel management portal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 724.89 Td (Bookings made through the approved travel desk are covered directly; other bookings) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 709.89 Td (require reimbursement approval from the department head.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 684.89 Td (Claims for daily allowance, lodging, and local transport must be submitted within thirty) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 669.89 Td (days of returning from travel. Original boarding passes and tax invoices are required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 56.00 654.89 Td (for air travel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 56 30 Td (Employee Handbook - demonstration sample - page 9 of 10) Tj ET
